// German texts of the R(ust)PG2D runtime (menus, windows, HUD, messages): English → German.
// `{}` stands for a value (in order), `{0}`, `{1}` reorder them. Keys are the exact English
// texts the game draws (engine/src/lang.rs). Only Latin-1 characters: the game font has no more.
